WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:03.520
- [Sam] The world is changing.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.820
Technology is absolutely vital

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:09.523
to fast-forward these changes.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:15.170
- [Man] Seven, six, five, four, three--

00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.970
- [Sam] I'm Sam Bird, and I
drive an electric racing car.

00:00:19.041 --> 00:00:22.041
(upbeat rock music)

00:00:31.864 --> 00:00:34.360
- Formula E is a single-seater
racing championship

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.800
but purely for electric vehicles.

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.320
- Formula E is going to
be the catalyst for people

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:42.200
believing that electric
vehicles are cool, fun

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.650
and that they are the future.

00:00:44.732 --> 00:00:47.460
- There's no other place in
the world where you can push

00:00:47.460 --> 00:00:50.283
these technologies so hard
that you can do in motor sports.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.713
- [Sam] Formula E is really
in the here and the now.

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:00.600
- Electric cars, they
are computers on wheels.

00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:02.470
Not only do we have to develop
the hardware of the car,

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:04.170
for sure the motor, the inverter.

00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:06.520
But also we have an awful lot
of software to be developing.

00:01:06.520 --> 00:01:09.720
There are probably a hundred
different topics we can work on

00:01:09.720 --> 00:01:13.130
to improve the overall efficiencies
of our electric racing cars.

00:01:13.130 --> 00:01:14.390
- That's why our partnership with

00:01:14.390 --> 00:01:16.540
Hewlett Packard Enterprise
is so important.

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:19.290
- Hewlett Packard Enterprise
have designed a really

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:20.300
bespoke IT solution.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:23.820
It is able to condense the
amount of time it takes from

00:01:23.820 --> 00:01:26.540
the data to go from the
car to the engineers.

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.410
We have reduced that time
from about two minutes

00:01:28.410 --> 00:01:29.700
to 10 seconds.

00:01:29.700 --> 00:01:32.380
That might sound marginal,
but shaving two minutes

00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:35.113
of non-productive time
is absolutely critical.

00:01:37.310 --> 00:01:40.400
- Racing is important not only
from a sporting perspective,

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:41.963
but from a life perspective.

00:01:42.920 --> 00:01:45.600
I firmly believe the
Formula E series will make

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.660
more people on the planet go green 

00:01:47.660 --> 00:01:50.010
because the technology
from here will go into

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.120
the production line and make a better,

00:01:52.120 --> 00:01:54.810
more affordable electric car.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:57.520
- It's not so much about the
speed of the car themselves.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:00.400
It's about the speed of
how our team operates 

00:02:00.400 --> 00:02:03.160
and how quickly we're able
to adopt new technologies,

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:05.070
and integrate them into our race cars.

00:02:05.070 --> 00:02:07.330
- That's why Formula E is so important.

00:02:07.330 --> 00:02:09.463
This is the catalyst of change.

